    {
      "id": "sol.amc-12b-2004-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Factoring, \\(1296 = 6^4 = 2^4 \\cdot 3^4.\\) Matching exponents gives \\(x = 4\\) and \\(y = 4,\\) so \\(x + y = 8.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is A.",
